  "rule_verdict_reasons": {
    "O1a_SMALL_WAW_TO_WAW_NOT_AFTER_HEH": "Accepted with a single neighbouring-codepoint guard. Unguarded it cost 12 CORRECT selections, all on the 3sg enclitic pronoun هُۥ, where U+06E5 notates the pronoun vowel's length rather than an omitted consonant. Guarded: 29 trigger tokens, 6 RECALL_GAP->CORRECT, 0 regressions.",
    "O2a_SMALL_YEH_TO_YEH_NOT_AFTER_HEH": "Accepted under the same guard, for the same reason (هِۦ). Unguarded it cost 5 CORRECT selections. Guarded: 22 trigger tokens, 0 conversions and 0 regressions - it is the exact mirror of O1a and is kept for that symmetry, with its zero net gain recorded rather than hidden.",
    "O3_SILENT_LETTER_DROP": "WITHDRAWN. Corpus-wide it moved 5 tokens RECALL_GAP->CORRECT but cost 5 CORRECT selections and created 5 new INCORRECT ones. Gain and regression share an identical codepoint structure - نَدْعُوا۟ against كَاشِفُوا۟ - so no narrower general condition separates them; the only structural narrowing available deletes every gain along with every regression. A token allowlist was not an option, so the rule was withdrawn rather than special-cased.",
    "O4X_PLURAL_WAW_OTIOSE_ALEF": "REJECTED. 12 triggers in the v1 bucket, 0 closures: CAMeL returns no analysis for جاءوا / جَآءُوا / جاءوك / جاءوكم. What the جَآءُو family actually needs is a hamza carrier change (جاءو -> جاؤو reaches ج.ي.أ), not an alef.",
    "O5_SMALL_SEEN_SAD_TO_SEEN": "Accepted unconditionally. 2 trigger tokens, 1 RECALL_GAP->CORRECT (وَيَبْصُۜطُ), 0 regressions.",
    "O6X_FINAL_ALEF_TO_MAQSURA": "DEFERRED. Closes 14 tokens but no source notation licenses it and its additions are majority noise (+41 teacher-matching / +87 not; +108 / +297 on وَرَءَا)."
  },
